WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.343
Nura brings your Apple Watch data into one view.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.283
Start with today's summary, and see what contributes to your
health score.

3
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.605
Then take a longer view. A selected-period score summarizes the
dates you choose.

4
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:20.631
Daily bars and a twenty-eight-day line keep the two views
distinct.

5
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.929
Open a workout. Follow its heart-rate trace, and see time in
each zone.

6
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:32.311
Use the calendar to return to a day, with the weeks that led up
to it.

7
00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:39.833
Sleep and recovery add context. The scores are estimates, with
their inputs shown.

8
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.295
Nura. Health data, made understandable.
